    season: 1
    sound: ptbr_ep8_bbt_1a
    id: 0
    episode: 7
    emotion: regular
    slug: intro
    minigame: 1
  - text: "O que \xE9 essa m\xE1quina? Aposto que, se voc\xEA colocar as pe\xE7as
