    season: 1
    sound: ptbr_ep7_bbt_1d
    id: 3
    episode: 8
    emotion: regular
    slug: error2
    minigame: 1
  - text: Um vaso ali, a tocha do outro lado, o escudo na parede e a espada... Tente
