    season: 3
    sound: ptbr_ep24_bbt_0d
    id: 3
    episode: 8
    emotion: regular
    slug: minigame1
    minigame: 
  - text: "Talvez n\xF3s possamos usar essa informa\xE7\xE3o para deter o rob\xF4..."
