    sound: ptbr_ep24_bbt_0i
    id: 8
    episode: 8
    emotion: regular
    slug: minigame4
    minigame: 
  - text: "Ei, o que ser\xE1 aquela coisa logo ali?"
    world: 1
    season: 3
    sound: ptbr_ep24_bbt_0j_1
    id: 9
    episode: 8
    emotion: regular
    slug: minigame4
    minigame: 
  - text: "\xC9 o Senhor Sombrio! Ou ser\xE1 que devemos cham\xE1-lo de Ing\xEAnio?"
    world: 1
    season: 3
    sound: ptbr_ep24_bbt_0j_2
    id: 10
    episode: 8
    emotion: regular
    slug: minigame5
    minigame: 
  - text: "Me proteja Guardi\xE3o!"
    world: 1
    season: 3
    sound: ptbr_ep24_bbt_0k
    id: 11
    episode: 8
    emotion: regular
    slug: minigame5
    minigame: 
  - text: "O que voc\xEA encontrou a\xED? \xC9 um tipo de manual do rob\xF4?"
    world: 1
    season: 3
    sound: ptbr_ep24_bbt_1a
    id: 0
    episode: 8
    emotion: regular
    slug: intro
    minigame: 1
  - text: "Interessante, mas... n\xE3o h\xE1 algo de errado? O texto n\xE3o bate com
