    season: 3
    sound: ptbr_ep24_bbt_5e_2
    id: 5
    episode: 8
    emotion: regular
    slug: error3
    minigame: 5
  - text: Olhe! O painel solar jogou a luz direto no Senhor Sombrio!
    world: 1
    season: 3
    sound: ptbr_ep24_bbt_5g
    id: 6
    episode: 8
    emotion: regular
    slug: victory
    minigame: 5
  - text: "Ser\xE1 que acabou? Eu \xE9 que n\xE3o chego perto dele!"
    world: 1
    season: 3
    sound: ptbr_ep24_bbt_0l
    id: 7
    episode: 8
    emotion: regular
    slug: victory
    minigame: 5
  - text: "E ent\xE3o? S\xF3 tem p\xF3 a\xED?"
    world: 1
    season: 3
    sound: ptbr_ep24_bbt_6a
    id: 8
    episode: 8
    emotion: regular
    slug: victory
    minigame: 5
  - text: "Duvido que seja a \xFAltima vez que veremos o Senhor Sombrio. Um vil\xE3o
